  {
   "citation": "Teranode marks blocks invalid in its blocks table and its reconsider clears the block it names (services/rpc/handlers.go:1919-2028, services/blockvalidation/BlockValidation.go:2001-2042) [SRC]; the reference's reconsiderblock clears the failure marks of the named block's ancestors and re-activates (src/rpc/blockchain.cpp:2770-2818, src/validation.cpp:4913-5126) [SRC]. Reconsidering the invalidated block itself brings both to the same tip",
