   "citation": "Teranode has no traditional mempool by design (docs/topics/architecture/teranode-overall-system-design.md:174) [LIT]: an unmined transaction is a store record stamped UnminedSince (stores/utxo/meta/data.go:61) [SRC] and kept, the pruner deleting only mined or conflicting records (Lifetimes.prune_only_mined_or_conflicting); the reference expires a pool entry after -mempoolexpiry (336 hours, policy; src/txmempool.cpp:2201-2220, src/config.cpp:87) [SRC]",
